    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Pit- Playmar",
      "Cocktails\nUNITED'S VERY DRY BEEFEATER MARTINI\nUNITED'S VERY DRY SMIRNOFF SILVER VODKA MARTIN\nOLD FASHIONED MANHATTAN\nSCREWDRIVER\nBLOODY MARY\nMAI TAI\nDAIQUIRI\nWHISKEY SOUR\nenter\nMOVIES\nheatre\nSpirits\nI. W. HARPER BOURBON\nCUTTY SARK SCOTCH\nCHIVAS REGAL SCOTCH\nSEAGRAMS V.O.\nJACK DANIELS TENNESSEE WHISKEY\nBEEFEATER GIN\nSMIRNOFF VODKA BACARDI RUM\nCHRISTIAN BROTHERS BRANDY\n1.50\nWines and Beer\nCHAMPAGNE\nDRY SACK SHERRY\nRED WINE\nWHITE WINE\n1.00\nDOMESTIC BEER\n.50\n* *\nCOMPLIMENTARY SOFT BEVERAGES\nMinors Will Not Be Served Liquor.\nTo Begin\nFRUIT CUP\nYour Choice of\nSPANISH OMELETTE\nGRILLED CANADIAN BACON\nHASH BROWNED POTATOES\nor\nFRENCH TOAST\nSYRUP\nGRILLED HAM STEAK\nBRIOCHE ROLL\nBUTTER PAT\nCOFFEE\nBeverages\nSANKA\nTEA\nMILK\nThis menu prepared in United Airlines Flight Kitchen\nat Los Angeles, Raoul Delbol, Executive Chef.\nMember, Societe Culinaire Philanthropique; Club Gastronomique\nProsper Montagne; Chevalier de l'Ordre de Saint Fortunat.\nPlease accept our apology if your choice is not available.\nLAXHH\nR4-1"
